katago
------------------------------------------
KataGo has begun its first public distributed training run! See
https://katagotraining.org/ for more details, to download the latest and
strongest neural nets, or to learn how to contribute if you want to help KataGo
improve further!

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libOpenCL1-2.3.5-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  libzip5-1.5.1-1
  zlib0-1.4-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.13-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libOpenCL-devel-2.3.5-1
  libzip-devel-1.5.1-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1
  zlib-devel-1.4-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/lightvector/KataGo

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/lightvector/KataGo/archive/refs/tags/v1.18.2.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack katago-1.18.2-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./katago-1.18.2-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/katago-1.18.2-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/katago-1.18.2-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

